.TH "gnutls_pubkey_import_mldsa_raw" 3 "3.8.14" "gnutls" "gnutls"
.SH NAME
gnutls_pubkey_import_mldsa_raw \- API function
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <gnutls/abstract.h>
.sp
.BI "int gnutls_pubkey_import_mldsa_raw(gnutls_pubkey_t " key ", gnutls_pk_algorithm_t " algo ", const gnutls_datum_t * " pub ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "gnutls_pubkey_t key" 12
The structure to store the parsed key
.IP "gnutls_pk_algorithm_t algo" 12
one of \fBGNUTLS_PK_MLDSA44\fP, \fBGNUTLS_PK_MLDSA65\fP, or \fBGNUTLS_PK_MLDSA87\fP
.IP "const gnutls_datum_t * pub" 12
holds the raw public key
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
This function will convert the given raw ML\-DSA public key (FIPS 204
public key encoding) to a \fBgnutls_pubkey_t\fP.  The output will be
stored in  \fIkey\fP .   \fIpub\fP must have the length required by  \fIalgo\fP (1312, 1952, or 2592 octets respectively).
.SH "RETURNS"
On success, \fBGNUTLS_E_SUCCESS\fP (0) is returned, otherwise a
negative error value.
.SH "SINCE"
3.8.14
